    "text": "<p>The Born-Haber cycle for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>KCl</mi></math> is evaluated with the following data:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#920;</mi></msup><mtext>&#160;for&#160;</mtext><mi>KCl</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>436.7</mn><msup><mi>kJmol</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>sub</mi></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#920;</mi></msup><mtext>&#160;for&#160;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>89.2</mn><msup><mi>kJmol</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mtext>ionization&#160;</mtext></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#920;</mi></msup><mtext>&#160;for&#160;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>419.0</mn><mi>kJ</mi><msup><mtext>&#160;mol&#160;</mtext><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mtext>electron gain&#160;</mtext></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#920;</mi></msup><mtext>&#160;for&#160;</mtext><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>348.6</mn><msup><mi>kJmol</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mtext>bond&#160;</mtext></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#920;</mi></msup><mtext>&#160;for&#160;</mtext><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>243.0</mn><msup><mi>kJmol</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn><